  "description": "Adds a floating \"Edit in Umbraco\" pill on public pages, visible only to logged-in backoffice editors, that jumps straight to the content editor for the current node. Zero configuration after dotnet add package.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "Lait.Umbraco.GoToContent",
