  "published": "2026-08-18T13:23:55.327Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixes for the pill failing to appear. Declares the Umbraco dependency again (required for Umbraco Marketplace listing). The pill is now static HTML instead of being built by an inline script, so a strict script-src CSP no longer suppresses it. Preview mode no longer hides the pill site-wide for the rest of the browser session; only nested documents (iframes) are skipped. Reserved paths are matched on segment boundaries, so pages such as /installation are no longer excluded. The node is resolved lazily, so virtual and custom-routed pages get a pill. Cache headers are applied before the response starts, fixing an InvalidOperationException. Every decision not to inject is now logged with its reason under the Lait.GoToContent category.",
